lands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://levityinteractive.com/privacy-policy-2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://levityinteractive.com/terms-conditions", "publisher_name": "Levity Interactive LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://levityinteractive.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "271683